  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_0
    value: "<size=20>\n- When Boost Link Bonus is chosen, lock all triggering             symbols
      and award 5 re-spins\n   in the remaining spots.\n- All spots spin independently.
      Only           ,             and            symbols may appear.\n- When any
      \           appear,  lock them in place and award the sum total  of           symbol
      pays\n   at the point of trigger. \n- When any            appear, lock them
      in place and award the sum total of all existing pays \n   on the screen. \n-
      When           appears, award one additional free spin.           symbol disappears
      and does not \n  get locked.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: "<size=19>\n- If the bonus was triggered by 9 or more            ,            symbols
      will be removed from the bonus.\n- If the bonus was triggered by 11 or more
      \         ,            symbols get a Multiplier equal to \n   number of triggering
      Red Safari symbols minus 9.\n- When Green Multiplier exists, apply the multiplier
      to the sum total of all existing pays on the screen.\n- If all spots are filled,
      apply a 2x multiplier to the final Boost Link Bonus pay.\n</size>"
